{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56358","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 里无叹兮二章（一章十二句，一章□句）（里无叹兮，洽颂声也。） 一 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 里无叹兮二章（一章十二句，一章□句）（里无叹兮，洽颂声也。） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公之来矣，里无叹兮。\n清猷濬发，舆颂争驰。\n仁声旁达，廉风□□。\n□白携手，其乐如之。\n流转保业，其心归心。\n□不□响，耕无随时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}